/-!
# UUID registration table and drain-before-reuse discipline

Models `KVCacheManagerWithTransfer`'s UUID-keyed session tables
(`active_recv_sessions_[uuid]` on the decode consumer and `send_sessions_[uuid]`
on the prefill producer) and its terminal report sets (`done_sending_`,
`done_recving_`, `failed_recving_`) across duplicate announcements, conflicting
UUIDs, and session retries (`KVCacheManagerWithTransfer::NotifyForRead`,
`KVCacheManagerWithTransfer::StartRead(remote_endpoint)`,
`KVCacheManagerWithTransfer::CompleteReadWithDetails`,
`KVCacheManagerWithTransfer::CompleteReadRaw` in
`tpu_sync/kv_cache/kv_cache_manager_with_transfer.cc`,
`SendLifecycleTest.DuplicateRegistrationCannotReplaceLiveOffer` and
`RecvDrainTest.DuplicateUuidIsRejectedUntilExpiredReceiveDrains` in
`tpu_sync/kv_cache/kv_cache_manager_with_transfer_send_drain_test.cc`, and
`ControlHandshakeTest.DuplicateReceiveDoesNotReplaceOrLeakFirstRead` and
`ControlHandshakeTest.RepeatedReceiveAnnouncementIsIdempotent` in
`tpu_sync/kv_cache/kv_cache_manager_with_transfer_control_test.cc`).

